            uniform mediump sampler2D _BumpMap;\nUNITY_LOCATION(4) uniform mediump
            samplerCube _Cube;\nin highp  vec4 vs_TEXCOORD0;\nin highp  vec2 vs_TEXCOORD1;\nin
