            + u_xlat16_1;\n    u_xlat1 = u_xlat16_1;\n    u_xlatb2 = u_xlat1<0.0;\n   
            u_xlati2 = u_xlatb2 ? int(0xFFFFFFFFu) : int(0);\n    if((u_xlati2)!=0){discard;}\n   
            SV_Target0 = u_xlat16_0;\n    return;\n}\n\n"
